<title>USA: Coastal, Westcoast to form joint venture.</title>
<headline>Coastal, Westcoast to form joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Corp and Westcoast Energy Inc plan to form a joint venture to market natural gas and electricity by merging their related marketing and services units, the companies said in a joint statement Tuesday.</p>
<p>Coastal and Westcoast would each hold a 50 percent stake in the new company, which would handle seven billion cubic feet of natural gas per day and become a leading wholesaler of electricity in North America, the companies said.</p>
</text>
